Hi All,

I'm working with the Soil Water Assessment Tool (SWAT 2012) in the ArcMap interface.and am hoping to import the automated output from SWAT into R but am having some issues. An output file is generated as a text file but importing it is becoming cumbersome and problematic, I think the text file is formatted for FORTRAN as SWAT was built under FORTRAN but I'm not sure. Anyone with experience importing SWAT output into R? Happy to share code/files too.

Thanks

From ua2bfdf24157fa01a at groups.google.com  Thu Jan 18 23:49:11 2018
